  "reflectionText": "Samuel poured oil on Saul's head at the edge of the city, and the Spirit came mightily on him among the prophets. The people who had known him before asked: is Saul also among the prophets? What is it to have your name set down in a sentence the people who knew you cannot yet make sense of?"
